      "value": "The low hardware utilization is known due to using Unity's Built-In Render Pipeline (BIRP), which is single-threaded . The migration to Unified Render Pipeline (URP) probably won't have anytime soon without a potential content apocalypse for all user-made content available in VRChat since its inception in 2014.",
